        /// <summary>
        /// Test switch for the in-game creation flow: while Data/admin_test_newaccount.txt exists,
        /// an admin-allowlisted IP's cached-login picker answers [] even though its Steam/device
        /// already has accounts - so the client runs the NEW-PLAYER path (create_account ->
