        // Balance / currency anti-farm  (see BalanceGuard.cs + APIController.AddStorefrontBalance)
        // -----------------------------
        // POST /api/storefronts/v2/balance is the only endpoint that MINTS currency for a player.
        // It is now gated three ways, all decided on the SERVER from the player's live room
        // instance (never the request body):
        //   1. The player must actually be in a room instance (roomInstanceId + roomId), or the
        //      award is refused - "need your RoomInstanceId and RoomId".
